<title>RUSSIA: Russia's non-CIS July nickel exports were 20,098 T.</title>
<headline>Russia's non-CIS July nickel exports were 20,098 T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's July exports of nickel to countries outside the Commonwealth of Independent States were 20,098 tonnes, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>Interfax news agency quoted the committee as saying exports to non-CIS destinations over the first seven months of 1996 were 89,880 tonnes, up 5.4 percent from year-ago levels.</p>
<p>It gave no comparison figure for July.</p>
<p>The committee has said Russia's nickel output slipped seven percent in July from June.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
